SUMMARY:Local Author Book Fair
DESCRIPTION:Support local writers and explore stories from your own communi
 ty at the Library's 2nd annual Local Author Book Fair! Just in time for th
 e holiday season\, Lancaster Public Library will host the Local Author Boo
