 oor combined Community Room and Boardroom. Stop by the library to meet loc
 al authors and hear about the books they have written. Books will be avail
 able for sale and signing by the authors. Are you a local author? Authors 
 from the Lancaster-area who have either traditionally or self-published bo
 oks for adults\, teens\, or children in any genre are eligible to register
  for the Book Fair. Space is limited\, but preference will be given to the
  first 10 authors to complete the registration form. https://bit.ly/3WrONy
